---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import StaticPage from '../components/StaticPage.astro';

const updated = '15 September 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Cookie Policy — DivyaKatha"
  description="How DivyaKatha uses cookies, including Google Analytics, and how you can control them."
>
  <StaticPage
    title="Cookie Policy"
    description="What cookies this site uses and how to manage them in your browser."
  >
    <p class="post-meta">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <p>
      This page explains how <strong>DivyaKatha</strong> uses cookies and similar technologies.
      For broader privacy practices, see our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
    <p>
      Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help sites
      remember preferences, keep sessions secure, or understand how pages are used.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies we use</h2>

    <h3>Essential cookies</h3>
    <p>
      These are needed for basic site operation. They may include a cookie that remembers you dismissed
      our cookie notice. Without them, some convenience features may not work as expected.
    </p>

    <h3>Analytics cookies (Google Analytics)</h3>
    <p>
      We use Google Analytics (measurement ID <strong>G-S7DXESED8M</strong>) to collect aggregated
      statistics about visits — such as which pages are read, how long visitors stay, and general
      device/location information. Google may set cookies like <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_*</code>
      to distinguish users and sessions.
    </p>
    <p>
      Analytics helps us improve DivyaKatha. We do not use analytics data to build advertising profiles
      on this site today.
    </p>

    <h2>Future advertising cookies</h2>
    <p>
      If we add advertising (for example, Google AdSense) later, additional cookies may be used to
      serve and measure ads. We will update this page before enabling such features.
    </p>

    <h2>How to control cookies</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Browser settings</strong> — most browsers let you block or delete cookies. Look for
        "Privacy" or "Cookies" in your browser preferences.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Google Analytics opt-out</strong> — install
        <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google's Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>
        to prevent Analytics from collecting data about your visits.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Do Not Track</strong> — some browsers send a DNT signal. We do not currently change
        behaviour based on DNT alone, but you can still limit cookies through your browser.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Blocking analytics cookies will not stop you from reading the site, but we will have less
      insight into how stories are enjoyed.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about cookies? Email
      <a href="mailto:admin@rishabh-anand.com">admin@rishabh-anand.com</a>
      or visit our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </StaticPage>
</Base>
